            "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for sharing! Looks nice.\r\n\r\nOne massive thing that I'd recommend changing is to move all `vim.api.nvim_set_hl()` call outside of the autocommand callback. They only need to be created once. And indeed I'd personally not use namespace, but it is fine either way.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Thanks for sharing! Looks nice.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">One massive thing that I'd recommend changing is to move all <code class=\"notranslate\">vim.api.nvim_set_hl()</code> call outside of the autocommand callback. They only need to be created once. And indeed I'd personally not use namespace, but it is fine either way.</p>",
