            "author": {
                "avatarUrl": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/35547958?u=ffc582e8893bbde3643f5a8ffad39ef821838678&v=4",
                "login": "vandalt",
                "resourcePath": "/vandalt",
                "url": "https://github.com/vandalt"
            },
            "authorAssociation": "NONE",
            "body": "Thanks for this @drowning-cat!\r\n\r\nI could not get the highlight working since I'm in a \"minus\" time zone.\r\n\r\nHere is an updated `GitBlameDate` match that should work for both (I think):\r\n\r\n```lua\r\n    vim.fn.matchadd(\"GitBlameDate\", leftmost .. [[[0-9-]\\{10} [0-9:]\\{8} [+-]\\d\\+]])\r\n```\r\n\r\nI just replaced `+` by `[+-]`.",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Thanks for this <a class=\"user-mention notranslate\" data-hovercard-type=\"user\" data-hovercard-url=\"/users/drowning-cat/hovercard\" data-octo-click=\"hovercard-link-click\" data-octo-dimensions=\"link_type:self\" href=\"https://github.com/drowning-cat\">@drowning-cat</a>!</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I could not get the highlight working since I'm in a \"minus\" time zone.</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Here is an updated <code class=\"notranslate\">GitBlameDate</code> match that should work for both (I think):</p>\n<div class=\"highlight highlight-source-lua notranslate position-relative overflow-auto\" dir=\"auto\" data-snippet-clipboard-copy-content=\"    vim.fn.matchadd(&quot;GitBlameDate&quot;, leftmost .. [[[0-9-]\\{10} [0-9:]\\{8} [+-]\\d\\+]])\"><pre class=\"notranslate\">    <span class=\"pl-smi\">vim</span>.<span class=\"pl-e\">fn</span>.<span class=\"pl-c1\">matchadd</span>(<span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span>GitBlameDate<span class=\"pl-pds\">\"</span></span>, <span class=\"pl-smi\">leftmost</span> <span class=\"pl-k\">..</span> <span class=\"pl-s\"><span class=\"pl-pds\">[[</span>[0-9-]\\{10} [0-9:]\\{8} [+-]\\d\\+<span class=\"pl-pds\">]]</span></span>)</pre></div>\n<p dir=\"auto\">I just replaced <code class=\"notranslate\">+</code> by <code class=\"notranslate\">[+-]</code>.</p>",
            "bodyText": "Thanks for this @drowning-cat!\nI could not get the highlight working since I'm in a \"minus\" time zone.\nHere is an updated GitBlameDate match that should work for both (I think):\n    vim.fn.matchadd(\"GitBlameDate\", leftmost .. [[[0-9-]\\{10} [0-9:]\\{8} [+-]\\d\\+]])\nI just replaced + by [+-].",
